{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ae20d943fc5bd5a13df4fc652fec906df726615d97e96f74a1d09f3717825630",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b33a9e249bd1a3dbb02e1920db224cc11b944776ebf1ec554d25cbad5efbb80d",
      "text": "……啊。喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c8120a1f2f21b8a67fb5ca8be68b1dfe3095dd73882064c123c38d8f7f4581b",
      "text": "……谢谢。演唱会的余韵还在呢。\n就想再跟你多聊一会儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a23110dee558d7349ca495ae35fc14d5b7606d34375cf70cc6fc698c2dbc795e",
      "text": "今天的演唱会辛苦了。\n客人们都超级热情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71e410108687b81bfe67a026e3777598dce286a75e64ca3b40fddafed1a87610",
      "text": "我就想听听看，在●●●●プロデューサー眼里，\n看到的是怎样的光景呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29587fe58c4bbfa00668e4020c55242a2b34a9cf7d19c909bd476841cab116d8",
      "text": "……嗯，这样啊。听你这么说我就放心了。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_b:2_4_027_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33c71b458f4575aa106e8ca88d2d59d7490f60c36f555f3193dc907dd2041baa",
      "text": "下次演唱会也希望能带给大家最棒的款待。\n剩下的回事务所再聊吧。回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
